<title>UK: Bank Vontobel sets warrants on Novartis.</title>
<headline>Bank Vontobel sets warrants on Novartis.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank J Vontobel says it has issued five million call warrants, on Novartis AG.</p>
<p>50 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,800.00 CHF	    PREMIUM	9.56 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.41 CHF		  GEARING	14.50 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 21.FEB.97-11.FEB.98   PAYDATE	21.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT =</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1,753.00 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
